        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Nahda</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egypt">Egypt</a> and the Ottoman <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/levant">Levant</a>, above all <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cairo">Cairo</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexandria">Alexandria</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beirut">Beirut</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/damascus">Damascus</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aleppo">Aleppo</a>, with echoes in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tunis">Tunis</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baghdad">Baghdad</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/istanbul">Istanbul</a> and among Arab emigrants in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/americas">Americas</a></span></div>
